  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Cultivation pots class feature, Extra Herbs</p>\n<p>If you can't cultivate it, it deserves to be extinct.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Select one herbalism plant whose description states that it cannot be grown in cultivation pots. You can now grow up to one specimen of that plant in your cultivation pots; however, using the extra cultivation green thumb ability on this plant costs 4 green thumb points rather than 2. Further, the plant's yield is halved when using the bounty of nature green thumb ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Cultivator Savant multiple times. Each time, select a new herbalism plant.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> If an herbalism plant says it cannot be grown in cultivation pots, then it simply cannot be grown in cultivation pots.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
